---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Modern Affiliate Matrix">
  <main class="matrix-shell">
    <section class="matrix-intro">
      <h1>PREMIUM TOOLS & RECOMMENDATIONS // AFFILIATE_LINKS</h1>
      <p>Curated hardware and software recommendations optimized for local AI computation, Dolphin3, and open-source LLM performance.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="matrix-grid">
      <article class="matrix-card">
        <header>
          <p class="card-label">RECOMMENDED AI HARDWARE</p>
          <h2>Local Computation Rig</h2>
        </header>
        <p>The exact local hardware configuration optimized to run Dolphin3 and open-source LLMs offline seamlessly.</p>
        <a class="card-link" href="YOUR_AFFILIATE_LINK_HERE" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Explore the Rig</a>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="matrix-footer">
      <h2>CONNECT / TRANSMIT SIGNALS</h2>
      <div class="social-links">
        <a href="https://x.com/yourhandle" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">X_TWITTER</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/yourhandle" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GITHUB_CORE</a>
        <a href="mailto:your@email.com">EMAIL_DIRECT</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  :global(body) {
    background: #090b10;
    color: #c9d1d9;
  }

  .matrix-shell {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }

  .matrix-intro {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .matrix-intro h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.25rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #f8fafc;
  }

  .matrix-intro p {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 72ch;
    color: #8b949e;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .matrix-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .matrix-card {
    position: relative;
    border: 1px solid #30363d;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: #161b22;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    transition: transform 0.28s ease, border-color 0.28s ease, box-shadow 0.28s ease, background 0.28s ease;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .matrix-card:hover,
  .matrix-card:focus-within {
    transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.005);
    border-color: #58a6ff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(88, 166, 255, 0.18);
  }

  .matrix-card:hover .card-label,
  .matrix-card:focus-within .card-label {
    color: #58a6ff;
  }

  .matrix-card:hover h2,
  .matrix-card:focus-within h2 {
    color: #f5f5ff;
  }

  .card-label {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.24em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #8b949e;
  }

  .matrix-card h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #c9d1d9;
  }

  .matrix-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #9da5b4;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .card-link {
    align-self: flex-start;
    margin-top: auto;
    color: #58a6ff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    transition: color 0.2s ease, text-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .card-link:hover,
  .card-link:focus-visible {
    color: #ffd070;
    text-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(255, 208, 112, 0.2);
  }

  .matrix-footer {
    border-top: 1px solid #30363d;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .matrix-footer h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #c9d1d9;
  }

  .social-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .social-links a {
    color: #8b949e;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid #30363d;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.15rem;
    background: rgba(20, 25, 34, 0.9);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }

  .social-links a:hover,
  .social-links a:focus-visible {
    color: #58a6ff;
    border-color: #58a6ff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(88, 166, 255, 0.18);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .matrix-shell {
      padding: 2rem 1rem 3rem;
    }

    .matrix-footer {
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .social-links {
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
